{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34258","headline":"奉和袭美茶具十咏 茶鼎 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美茶具十咏 茶鼎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新泉气味良，古铁形状丑。\n那堪风雪夜，更值烟霞友。\n曾过赬石下，又住清溪口。\n且共荐臯卢，何劳倾斗酒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34258.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34258","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}